    "text": "thehomepagenetwork.com\nwebsite\nTioga County, Pennsylvania\nPaws, Applause & Aerial Tricks: Aim High Canines Wow at the Fair\n28 minutes ago\nThe Tioga County Fair is in full swing and there is so much fun to be had! Today The Home Page Network visited the Aim High Canines and had a great time watching the talented dogs perform tricks and stunts that amaze young and old. The dogs will be performing three times a day, every day through Saturday, the last day of the fair. To see Aim High Canines performance schedule as well as all entertainment at the fair, check out the Tioga County Fair web-site at TiogaCountyFair.com.\n1",
